   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Today is Monday. It is my first day at a new job. My team makes a chat program. This is the hardware. I see the device. The repository is new to me. Maria shows me the README file. Maria smiles and says, \"Nice to meet you.\" I answer, \"How are you doing?\" Maria helps me a lot.",
   "tts": "Today is Monday. It is my first day at a new job. My team makes a chat program. This is the hardware. I see the device. The repository is new to me. Maria shows me the read me file. Maria smiles and says, \"Nice to meet you.\" I answer, \"How are you doing?\" Maria helps me a lot.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "今天是周一，是我新工作的第一天。我的团队在做一个聊天程序。这是硬件。我看到了设备。仓库对我来说很新。Maria 给我看了README 文件。Maria微笑着说：\"很高兴认识你。\"我回答：\"你最近怎么样？\"Maria 帮了我很多。",
