  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "At noon, Maria sits with me. She introduces the team. Maria says the pattern, and I repeat it: My name is ... Priya says, \"I'm new here.\" The monitor is new to me. Maria shows me the keyboard. I point to source code. I look at the project folder. I feel good today.",
   "tts": "At noon, Maria sits with me. She introduces the team. Maria says the pattern, and I repeat it: My name is  Priya says, \"I'm new here.\" The monitor is new to me. Maria shows me the keyboard. I point to source code. I look at the project folder. I feel good today.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "中午，Maria 和我坐在一起。她把我介绍给团队。Maria 说出这个句型，我跟着重复：我的名字是……Priya说：\"我是新来的。\"显示器对我来说很新。Maria 给我看了键盘。我指着源代码。我看着项目文件夹。我今天感觉很好。",
