  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I do one last thing. This is code hosting. I see the public repository. The mouse is new to me. Maria shows me the power button. Maria smiles and says, \"Where are you from?\" I answer, \"See you later.\" I am tired, but happy. Tomorrow I will learn more.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I do one last thing. This is code hosting. I see the public repository. The mouse is new to me. Maria shows me the power button. Maria smiles and says, \"Where are you from?\" I answer, \"See you later.\" I am tired, but happy. Tomorrow I will learn more.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我做最后一件事。这是代码托管。我看到了公开仓库。鼠标对我来说很新。Maria 给我看了电源按钮。Maria微笑着说：\"你来自哪里？\"我回答：\"回头见。\"我有点累，但很开心。明天我会学到更多。",
